  "notes": "An accounting term: sorting each transaction into debit ({借方|かりかた}) and credit ({貸方|かしかた}) accounts. Written {仕訳|しわけ}; do not confuse with ⟦{仕分|しわ}け→仕分ける：20080_shiwakeru⟧ (sorting, dividing things up).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {仕訳|しわけ}{帳|ちょう}: journal (book of original entry)\n- {仕訳|しわけ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{切|き}る→切る：02693_kiru⟧: to make a journal entry\n- {自動|じどう}{仕訳|しわけ}: automatic journal entry (in accounting software)",
